<title>FRANCE: Thomson bids may be made end-Sept - source.</title>
<headline>Thomson bids may be made end-Sept - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom and Lagardere Groupe, rival bidders for the Thomson SA electronics group, are making &quot;due diligence&quot; studies and could make firm offers by the end of September, a source close to the deal said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Separate &quot;data rooms&quot; have been set up for Alcatel, Lagardere and Daewoo Electronics to study Thomson documents to allow them to draw up their bids, said the executive, who declined to be named.</p>
<p>Daewoo has teamed up with Lagardere to buy the Thomson Multimedia consumer products unit if Lagardere wins the bidding.</p>
</text>
